phase_log_summary.user_prompt_template:
Summarize the following phase log for human review.

Phase name: {phase_name}
Status: {status}
Log excerpt:
{log_excerpt}

Return JSON with keys: summary, remaining_blockers (list), human_review_notes (list).

validator_result_explain.user_prompt_template:
Explain the following validator result for human review.

Validator: {validator_name}
Result: {result}
Issues:
{issues}

Return JSON with keys: summary, risk_notes (list), next_checkpoints (list).

product_summary.user_prompt_template:
Generate a dry-run product summary for human review.

Title: {title}
Publisher: {publisher}
Genre: {genre}

Return JSON with keys: summary, selling_points (list), caution_notes (list).

social_post_draft.user_prompt_template:
Draft social post candidates for human review.

Topic: {topic}
Source summary: {source_summary}
Target audience: {target_audience}

Return JSON with keys: draft_candidates (list), risk_notes (list), human_review_notes (list).

article_outline.user_prompt_template:
Generate an article outline for human review.

Topic: {topic}
Target reader: {target_reader}
Key points: {key_points}

Return JSON with keys: outline (list), title_candidates (list), human_review_notes (list).

compliance_classify.user_prompt_template:
Classify the following content for compliance review.

Content excerpt: {content_excerpt}
Context: {context}

Return JSON with keys: classification_label, risk_notes (list), requires_human_review (boolean, always true).

security_log_explain.user_prompt_template:
Explain the following security log excerpt for human review.

Log excerpt: {log_excerpt}
Detector result: {detector_result}

Return JSON with keys: summary, risk_notes (list), recommended_human_checks (list).
